BHegiWfvCROcvJ-gi-scceatrHgnWuUAVfxoFP3dKcsS4jE8Mf0x2jxqSwfgKk48&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af9nRltvByDI48emZWstGbVe8Hh34HAxn3ueVSHqTfw2WA&oe=6A2816BA"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "esta si final.png", "id": "894733870197987", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491820496_894733873531320_5461844353364296109_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=wB6ypgiOd4sQ7kNvwFPEpf_&_nc_oc=Ado8FuO73Enq3HcedxDV6a3kc8_9RypxEeMjmh6p9unfMW0zvhoMsEcCtxuf64j8Wjg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af85MESLTLOrNGL-pwf6ORqH1IHlPVi03pWnCj-hnBJ9Ww&oe=6A2813F8"}, "display_name": "MARS INVASION RED DAWN DEMO", "keywords": ["mars", "invasion", "red", "dawn", "shooter"], "long_description": "Mars Invasion: Red Dawn (VR Shooter) DEMO FREE\nAVAILABLE NOW! Action, Adrenaline, and Premium VR Quality.\n\nStep into the boots of Ripper, Mars\u2019 last defender, in this fast-paced, demanding sci-fi VR shooter. Hold back the relentless swarms of alien spiders across compact arenas, expertly designed for constant motion and total adrenaline.\n\n\u2694\ufe0f CORE GAMEPLAY: THE ULTIMATE CHALLENGE\nDynamic Arsenal: Master combat with the lightsaber, laser pistol, proximity bombs, machine gun, and heavy weapons. Every combination changes your strategy, forcing you to read the battlefield every single second.\n\n10 Expertly Crafted Scenarios: Fight aboard the invaded \"Light of Orion\" ship, the unforgiving Martian arrival, the mining colony, and extreme environments like the Sandstorm and the Martian Dark Night.\n\nLeticia, Your Tactical AI: Receive critical, real-time intelligence to ensure you are never caught off guard in the chaos.\n\n\u2705 VR EXPERIENCE WITH ZERO COMPROMISE\n100% Premium: NO MICROTRANSACTIONS. NO FILLER. A complete experience, with guaranteed hours of gameplay and constant updates ensuring maximum value and replayability.\n\nTotal VR Comfort: Designed for standing play with physical movement (roomscale). Extreme optimization prevents motion sickness, allowing for maximum immersion and a completely comfortable experience.\n\nUncover the story with every mission you survive.\n\nAre you ready for the invasion?\n\nThe quality action you\u2019ve been waiting for in VR.", "short_description": "In Mars, there's only one rule: kill or be killed. You are Ripper, a defender who travels to Mars. With Leticia, your AI companion who provides advice and strategies, you fight against waves of alien spiders in direct combat. Switch between swords, dual pistols, and heavy weapons. Feel every impact, crush the enemy, and adapt your style. No microtransactions, no filler. A premium, lethal, and relentless VR experience. You buy once. You kill forever. Are you ready for the invasion?"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.termsfeed.com/live/d20d3443-adfc-4204-8f8c-c2f6c085b05a", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "DiFran Studios", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.difranstudio.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "3744040075834813"}, {"id": "1592192974313489"}, {"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "2691890164460465"}, {"id": "1008279844328894"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en", "en_US", "en_AU", "en_CA", "en_ZA", "en_GB", "es_AR", "es_CL", "es_CO", "es_MX", "es_PE", "es_PR", "es", "es_VE"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING", "SITTING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"],